  "title": "Want to, need to, decide to",
  "theory": [
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "md": "После некоторых глаголов действие идёт с **to**: **want to** go, **need to** buy, **decide to** stay, **hope to** see, **plan to** travel, **learn to** swim, **forget to** call."
    },
    {
      "kind": "table",
      "head": [
        "Глагол",
        "Пример"
      ],
      "rows": [
        {
          "cells": [
            "want to",
            "I want to sleep."
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "need to",
            "We need to hurry."
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "decide to",
            "She decided to stay."
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "hope to",
            "I hope to see you soon."
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "learn to",
            "He learnt to surf."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "tip",
      "md": "Отрицание — перед to: I **decided not to** go."
    }
  ],
